<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<head><title>Root</title></head>
	<style>
		img{
			display:block;
			margin:auto;
		}
		h1{
			text-align:center;
		}
		p{
			text-align:center;
		}
		
	</style>
	<body>
		<h1>Root</h1>
		<img src="images/root.jpg" alt="plant" usemap="#map">
		<p>A plant root is the underground, non-green part of the plant axis that anchors the plant and absorbs water and minerals from the soil.</p>
	</body>
</html>
						
				
